        omtp11tPlusOduTcm1BackwardIncomingAlignmentErrorAlarm OBJECT-TYPE
		SYNTAX  DisplayString
		MAX-ACCESS  read-only
		STATUS  current
		DESCRIPTION
			"For port configured with OTU2 traffic, 
			the presence of this alarm conveys that
			TCM1 incoming alignment error (IAE) condition is 
			detected in the far-end card.
			-----------------------------
			omtp11tPlusInterfaceNumber:
			1 - LINE-1
			2 - LINE-2
			-----------------------------
			Values :
			If Alarm is Present - Date and Time Stamp
				eg:2017-5-18,9:47:20.0,+5:30
			If Alarm is Absent  - 0
			-----------------------------"
               ::= { omtp11tPlusAlarmQueryEntry 64 }

